{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">連續兩天有猴子闖入港鐵路軌，荃灣站至大窩口站一度暫停服務。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.MONKEY-1100.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/20262TSebiKnF91784864152.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.MONKEY-1100.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">從港鐵提供的圖片所見，有猴子在荃灣站月台的路軌上。警方及漁護署職員到場後，將猴子捉走。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.MONKEY-1100_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026xLmtwv3WVh1784864157.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.MONKEY-1100_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事發在上午約九時，港鐵指荃灣站有猴子闖入，荃灣站至大窩口暫停服務，中環站至大窩口站就一度延至5分鐘一班。至大約10時許，荃灣綫服務回復正常。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-24T03:51:36.625208+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}